      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Removes a key and its associated value from the map.\n@param\tTargetMap\t\tThe map to remove the key and its associated value from\n@param\tKey\t\t\t\tThe key that will be used to look the value up\n@return\tTrue if an item was removed (False indicates nothing in the map uses the provided key)"
    },
